# A voiced talk heard by the teammate standing by: Cengiz's lines and the host's recorded goodbye show as bubbles
# on the client and play their clips there (voice bundles from the Modding API, Audio/bundles).

include session.coop
set cengiz 2a21bdef-5ade-4ef6-8a58-a45adb6a7464

A tpnear $cengiz 0 80
B tpnear $cengiz 60 0
sleep 3
A talk $cengiz
A skip
# The goodbye answer: the player bundle has it recorded (DT_PreApo_1_NPC_Cengiz_end_Dialogues_Global).
A expect dialogue contains "got to go" timeout=30
A choose got to go
A skip first
A expect dialogue contains "in=0" timeout=120
B expect counter linesshown >= 1 timeout=5
# The bubbles there came with Cengiz's clips, found in the client's own bundles.
B expect counter voiced >= 1 timeout=5
